{#snippet integrations()}

Color Horse's palette engine is also published as `colorhorse`, a zero-dependency npm package -- the same math behind this page, usable anywhere.

```sh
npm install colorhorse
```

```js
import { getScheme } from "colorhorse";

getScheme(colorOne, colorTwo);
```

Pass in your two anchor colors to get the palette back as CSS custom properties, or as a plain JS object keyed by role:

{/snippet}

